    <string name="player_next_caption_random_old">A file from anywhere in your library folders that you\'ve never bookmarked and haven\'t touched in %1$d days. If nothing is that old yet, the oldest ones are used.</string>
    <string name="player_next_caption_random_here">The same pick, but only from the folder around what\'s playing — searched recursively. From inside a note\'s files folder it searches the folder that HOLDS them, so it works through every note\'s attachments rather than replaying this one\'s.</string>
    <string name="player_next_caption_newest_here">The same folder as \"Random here\", but the newest unbookmarked files rather than the oldest — for hearing what has just arrived instead of digging through the backlog.</string>
